OL,3,GNEWSADrivers voice pothole concerns as
OL,4,Aclaims top #19k
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Coventry driver whose tyre was
OL,7,Fdamaged twice in two days by potholes
OL,8,Fsaid the city's roads have "got a lot
OL,9,Fworse".
OL,11,FLuis Appleby-French said his tyre "blew
OL,12,Fout" after hitting an "unavoidable"
OL,13,Fpothole on Winsford Avenue in March.
OL,14,FThe following day, the same tyre was
OL,15,Fdamaged by another pothole on
OL,16,FFletchamstead Highway.
OL,18,FHis experience comes as the city
OL,19,Fcouncil revealed it pays an average of
OL,20,F#19,311 a year in pothole compensation.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
